# Project workspaces are private by default.
#
# Keep the registry and templates tracked, but ignore all per-project
# subfolders until a project is ready to be released from this repository.
# To release a project later, add explicit unignore rules for that folder, for
# example:
#
# !project_id_slug/
# !project_id_slug/**

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!PROJECT_TEMPLATE.md
